flowchart TB
accTitle: Replication and origin selection shorten the North American miss path
accDescr: CloudFront serves cache hits at the edge. On misses, Lambda at Edge selects a geographically appropriate S3 origin. The US origin is populated asynchronously from the European source before new map URLs are published.
U[Viewer requests map]:::inputData --> H{CloudFront cache hit?}:::decision
H -->|Yes| C[Return cached map]:::output
H -->|No| F[Origin-request function<br/>Select by viewer geography]:::process
F -->|North America| US[(S3 us-east-1)]:::storage
F -->|Europe| EU[(S3 eu-west-1)]:::storage
EU -.->|Async replication<br/>Verify before publishing| US
